diff --git a/saas/README.md b/saas/README.md
index 28b0891..6899a5f 100644
--- a/saas/README.md
+++ b/saas/README.md
@@ -105,3 +105,43 @@ knife ssh 'hostname:fizzy-lb-*' 'sudo docker exec fizzy-load-balancer kamal-prox
 ## License
 
 fizzy-saas is released under the [O'Saasy License](LICENSE.md).
+
+## Hosted billing
+
+Billing is enabled only in SaaS mode. Run the SaaS database migrations before
+shipping billing (`bin/rails db:migrate`). Existing accounts start on Free.
+
+Configure these environment variables (no publishable key is required because
+Stripe hosts the payment forms):
+
+* `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`: secret API key for the matching Stripe environment.
+* `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`: signing secret for `/stripe/webhooks`.
+* `STRIPE_UNLIMITED_PRICE_ID`: recurring USD $20/month price, Unlimited (5 GB).
+* `STRIPE_UNLIMITED_PLUS_PRICE_ID`: recurring USD $25/month price, Unlimited+ (500 GB).
+
+Create the monthly prices in Stripe, enable its customer portal (including plan
+switching and cancellation), and subscribe the webhook endpoint to
+`customer.subscription.created`, `customer.subscription.updated`, and
+`customer.subscription.deleted`. Checkout's return URL does not grant access;
+verified subscription events do. A cancellation scheduled for period end keeps
+paid benefits until Stripe ends the subscription. Past-due subscriptions retain
+access while Stripe retries payment; canceled, unpaid, incomplete, and paused
+subscriptions do not.
+
+Free allows 1,000 published cards and 1 GB. Drafts do not consume the card quota.
+Support at `/admin/accounts` can comp an account (Unlimited benefits), override
+measured card/storage usage, and reset those overrides without deleting cards or
+files. A paid subscription takes precedence over a comp, preserving Unlimited+
+storage. Existing explicit storage exceptions continue to take precedence over
+plan storage allowances.
+
+The billing tests run offline using stubbed Stripe API calls and locally signed
+webhook payloads; no Stripe account or network access is needed:
+
+```sh
+DATABASE_ADAPTER=sqlite bin/rails test saas/test/models/account/billing_test.rb \
+  saas/test/controllers/account/billings_controller_test.rb \
+  saas/test/controllers/stripe/webhooks_controller_test.rb \
+  saas/test/controllers/card/card_limited_test.rb \
+  saas/test/controllers/admin/accounts_controller_test.rb
+```
diff --git a/saas/app/controllers/account/billings_controller.rb b/saas/app/controllers/account/billings_controller.rb
